    "insurance": "",
    "description": "Crawford Roofing & Gutters LLC is a full-service roofing and gutter contractor led by Raymond Crawford, a second-generation contractor with over 21 years of construction experience. Built on a foundation of family expertise and proven craftsmanship, the company specializes in both residential and commercial roofing solutions, including new installations, replacements, and repairs. With a comprehensive service portfolio spanning multiple roofing materials—asphalt shingles, metal, TPO, EPDM, and flat roofing systems—Crawford Roofing delivers solutions tailored to every property type and budget.\n\nThe company's full-service capabilities extend to complete gutter systems, offering installation, repair, replacement, and seamless gutter solutions in various materials and configurations. Whether addressing storm damage, emergency leaks, hail damage, or routine maintenance, Crawford Roofing combines technical expertise with responsive service. Led by CEO Raymond Crawford and supported by Head of Sales and Project Manager Joe, whose nearly 10 years in residential and commercial roofing brings direct expertise in roof assessment and project estimation, the team ensures quality workmanship from initial consultation through project completion.\n\nServing residential and commercial clients alike, Crawford Roofing & Gutters LLC offers competitive pricing, financing options, and 24-hour emergency repair services to address urgent roofing and gutter needs. The company's commitment to comprehensive property care—combining roof repair, replacement, and gutter services under one trusted contractor—makes it a complete solution for protecting properties against the elements.",
